<metadata preset-name="Envelope Funk Quack" preset-author="Headroom" preset-comment="Greasy auto-wah funk: a compressor evens your picking into an optical envelope filter set to sweep up, then a clean blackface twin. The quack voicing is fixed on a vocal peak around 800 Hz; Quack and Vowel shape it. Dig in for more bark, play light for a rounder tone." based-on="" based-on-path=""/>
